        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079510/extras/df2c5c01b20da719e5a22dd9139d7ef6.poster.avif?t=1763128881\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079510/extras/df2c5c01b20da719e5a22dd9139d7ef6.webm?t=1763128881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079510/extras/df2c5c01b20da719e5a22dd9139d7ef6.mp4?t=1763128881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Our brain proceeds explanation and logic as safe and warm, the more you know, but once going into the unknown- the endless fear of possibilities drives the brain crazy, desperate for an answer. The storybook world is not bound by explanation or logic.<br><br>After receiving a chilling message from an old friend, you travel to her secluded cabin deep in the woods. What begins as a simple visit quickly descends into horror when she transforms into something inhuman. Trapped and disoriented, you must navigate a dark, rain-soaked forest filled with new terrors — using whatever you can find to survive and uncover what truly lurks behind her transformation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079510/extras/343e711f892992aa473b7e169b6500b5.poster.avif?t=1763128881\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079510/extras/343e711f892992aa473b7e169b6500b5.webm?t=1763128881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079510/extras/343e711f892992aa473b7e169b6500b5.mp4?t=1763128881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Explore, scavenge, and survive in a first-person horror experience that blends exploration with tension-driven encounters. Collect and use items found in the cabin and throughout the forest to progress, solve small environmental challenges, and stay one step ahead of the stalking creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rain dynamically alters gameplay — triggering unique events, changing visibility, and influencing the creatures’ behavior.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079510/extras/ca054e35802d57a53037662094205a31.poster.avif?t=1763128881\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079510/extras/ca054e35802d57a53037662094205a31.webm?t=1763128881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079510/extras/ca054e35802d57a53037662094205a31.mp4?t=1763128881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Dynamic Rain System:</strong> Weather that doesn’t just look real — it changes how the world reacts.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Persistent Threats:</strong> Evade your former friend and other horrifying entities roaming the woods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Exploration:</strong> Search cabins, ruins, and forest paths for key items and clues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense Survival Horror:</strong> Limited resources, eerie soundscapes, and no safe haven.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Driven Mystery:</strong> Piece together what happened to your friend and why the forest watches you back.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079510/extras/df2c5c01b20da719e5a22dd9139d7ef6.poster.avif?t=1763128881\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079510/extras/df2c5c01b20da719e5a22dd9139d7ef6.webm?t=1763128881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079510/extras/df2c5c01b20da719e5a22dd9139d7ef6.mp4?t=1763128881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Our brain proceeds explanation and logic as safe and warm, the more you know, but once going into the unknown- the endless fear of possibilities drives the brain crazy, desperate for an answer. The storybook world is not bound by explanation or logic.<br><br>After receiving a chilling message from an old friend, you travel to her secluded cabin deep in the woods. What begins as a simple visit quickly descends into horror when she transforms into something inhuman. Trapped and disoriented, you must navigate a dark, rain-soaked forest filled with new terrors — using whatever you can find to survive and uncover what truly lurks behind her transformation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079510/extras/343e711f892992aa473b7e169b6500b5.poster.avif?t=1763128881\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079510/extras/343e711f892992aa473b7e169b6500b5.webm?t=1763128881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079510/extras/343e711f892992aa473b7e169b6500b5.mp4?t=1763128881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Explore, sc